OL,3,APolanski vows to stay as Green leader
OL,4,Aas he faces criticism after by-election
OL,5,Adefeat
OL,6,
OL,7,FLichtenstein's comments come after two
OL,8,Fformer Green leaders accused Polanski
OL,9,Fof failing to show leadership over the
OL,10,FZionism row.
OL,12,FPolanski, who came second to Labour
OL,13,Fovernight in the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,14,Fby-election, told BBC Breakfast he
OL,15,Fwould "absolutely" stay on as leader
OL,16,Fand "of course" had not questioned
OL,17,Fthat.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
