OL,3,AHurricane Isaias strengthens to
OL,4,Acategory three as evacuations orders
OL,5,Aissued along US Gulf Coast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias is forecast to bring a
OL,8,F"life-threatening storm surge" to the
OL,9,FUS Gulf Coast when it makes landfall in
OL,10,Fthe early hours of Saturday morning
OL,12,FIsaias, the first hurricane of the
OL,13,FAtlantic season, is now a "major"
OL,14,Fcategory three storm, expected to
OL,15,Fimpact the states of Florida, Alabama,
OL,16,FGeorgia and Mississippi
OL,18,FEvacuation orders are in place for some
OL,19,Fliving in coastal communities as
OL,20,Fofficials encourage affected residents
OL,21,Fto "Get out NOW!"
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
